        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-DLW1RDDSBR, Elegant Reed Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your refrigerator or other appliances with these simple yet elegant handles. The Elegant Reed Appliance Pull is available in a ton of different finishes so you'll be able to find something that represents your dream kitchen. Made by First Impressions, these refrigerator handles are part of the Delaware Collection that features traditional designs that are beautifully styled. Choose from 18 inch or 24 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW01-specifications.gif?v=1704354502\" width=\"478\" height=\"231\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions AP-DLW1RDDSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/elegant-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-dlw1smtsbr\"><b>with smooth center</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-DLW1RDDSBR Delaware Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>These Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CF8301R-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354503\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW1RDDSBR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262277\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW1RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-DLW1018RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-DLW1024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
